 ("For an idempotent request, the linearization point is the committed response/usage record keyed by tenant and request identity. Provider completion alone is not sufficient because a crash before ledger persistence remains ambiguous and requires provider-side idempotency or reconciliation.","ailab/model_gateway.py","ModelGateway._record_success"),
